+ * starting at register idx, incrementing. The same stores and counters as
+ * the per-word loop below, without its per-word table lookup and branches:
+ * the program window maps a run onto consecutive vp[] words (the load
+ * pointer advances after every lane 3), the constant window onto
+ * consecutive constant words (its load pointer does not move). */
